*copy* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''copy(value)''

Returns an independent (deep) copy of ''value''. Numbers and strings are immutable and are returned unchanged.

*Parameters:*
- ''value'': Any value

*Returns:*
- An independent copy of ''value''

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if wrong number of arguments
- Runtime error if ''value'' contains itself
